@prefix orr: <https://ggen.io/ontology/owning-rail-remediation-realization#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

orr:Subject a prov:Entity .
orr:Rail a prov:Entity .
orr:RemediationPlan a prov:Plan .
orr:Observation a prov:Entity .
orr:Realization a prov:Entity .
orr:Receipt a prov:Entity .
orr:subjectSha a rdf:Property .
orr:semanticDigest a rdf:Property .
orr:targetsRail a rdf:Property .
orr:preState a rdf:Property .
orr:postState a rdf:Property .
orr:blockerBefore a rdf:Property .
orr:blockerAfter a rdf:Property .
orr:observedAt a rdf:Property .
orr:authority a rdf:Property .
orr:actuationPerformed a rdf:Property .
orr:realizationState a rdf:Property .
